// 通配导入的裸名不能盖住 Prelude：Prelude 是隐式注入的，用户没写任何 import
// 就默认拥有 print/panic/exit，静默换掉它是「编译能过、行为变了」。
import modules.prelude_clash.*;

fn main(): i32 {
    print("这条不该出现\n");
    return 0;
}

/** -- test
- .stderr
error: import from module 'modules.prelude_clash' brings in 'print', which is already provided by the prelude
--> tests/compile-fail/modules/import_shadows_prelude.tp:3:8
note: rename it, or call it as 'modules.prelude_clash.print(...)' with a namespace import
- .exit
1
-- */
